#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:13
msgid ""
"Turn debugging on or off. When debugging is on, the camera will attempt to "
"send text and image debugging information over the serial port. Turn "
"debugging off once a program is finished to improve performance."
msgstr "打开或关闭调试。调试打开时，相机将尝试通过串行端口发送文本和图像调试信息。程序完成后请关闭调试以提高性能。"

